    "No memory/CPU limits were added to ordinary Demo App containers in this experiment.",
    "The primary Core process is unchanged. Workspaces still exists but stopped before the test Cores launched; four unrelated containers were removed during the run and new container IDs appeared later. No experiment command targeted them; do not claim the whole host was unchanged."
