  "knownFindings": [
    "Default first-party bootstrap tries Shell on fixed port 7171; a managed test Core needs an explicit distribution profile and independent Shell port.",
    "Tag-only local artifact images are recreated at Core startup, including keep-apps, because the ordinary adapter requires a registry digest for adoption.",
    "Demo App artifact diagnostic health is 503 because /app/logs is absent; browser/auth/config probes pass.",
    "Process parentage alone does not stop a child Core; Docker containers survive Core SIGKILL.",
    "The parent Core environment-management API remains unimplemented."
  ],
